WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.502
-Guys, do you ever see
a photo in the news

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.937
and think the headline
could be much better?

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.405
♪ -Yeah ♪
-Usher?

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.740
[ Laughter ]
-Take a seat, Usher.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.308
-Usher -- he always wants
to get the last word.

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:10.510
-Always.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.812
-Usher, are you okay with us
doing this bit?

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.213
♪ -Yeah ♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:16.348
-Lil Jon?
♪ -Okay ♪

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:18.451
-Alright.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.754
It is time for
"News and Improved."

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:22.622
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:28.227
♪ -News and improved ♪

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:30.763
-For example, check out
this first photo.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:34.701
The original headline was
"Matsuyama wins the Masters."

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.769
That headline can
definitely be improved

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.737
because if you only looked at
the photo, the headline

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:41.507
could have been "friend cancels
Zoom happy hour."

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:44.344
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:46.446
Oh, too bad.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.047
Let's check out
this next photo here.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:51.851
The original headline was
"Biden unveils budget proposal."

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.286
-Oh, gosh.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.387
-But if you only looked at
the photo, the headline

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:58.490
could have been "friends insist
Botox is 'barely noticeable.'"

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.426
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:03.663
-I can't tell. I can't tell.

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.664
-Up next, this headline says,

00:01:05.664 --> 00:01:08.200
"Additional stimulus checks
debated."

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.669
Headline could have been,

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:12.438
"world's most annoying couple
signs dinner checks together."

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:14.140
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.108
"You write the tip."
"No, you write the tip."

00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:18.678
"No, you write the tip.
Let's both write the tip."

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:22.781
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.781 --> 00:01:24.751
This next headline was

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:27.920
"Putin orders talks on
new tax incentives."

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.389
Headline could have been

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:32.357
"guys ask drunk friend
across the table if he's okay."

00:01:32.357 --> 00:01:35.561
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:39.732
-"Right on. I'm great."

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:43.335
-Next headline was
"Merkel drafts new law."

00:01:43.335 --> 00:01:44.971
Headline could have been

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.740
"woman hears about Usher paying
strippers with fake bills."

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:52.311
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:56.482
Up next, this headline says,
"Sanders backs union."

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:59.686
The headline could have been
"man enters 14th minute

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:01.387
of trying to get
bartender's attention."

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:04.957
[ Laughter and applause ]
"I'll just try -- try --

00:02:04.957 --> 00:02:07.060
Just one -- Just --"

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.696
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:12.899
Sex on the beach!
Sex on the beach!

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:15.101
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:16.603
Next headline was

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:19.271
"administration kicks off
COVID relief tour."

00:02:19.271 --> 00:02:20.773
Headline could have been

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:23.876
"man goes viral with blindfolded
stair descent challenge."

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:29.148
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:33.253
Next headline was "soccer teams
prepare for finals."

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:36.088
Headline could have been "man
charges phone for two hours,

00:02:36.088 --> 00:02:38.358
realizes it wasn't plugged in."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:40.426
That's all the time we have
for "News and Improved."

